WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:02.301
- LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:05.304
PLEASE TURN OFF YOUR CELL PHONES
AND ENJOY OUR PRODUCTION

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:09.175
OF<i> LUNCH WITH GREATNESS.</i>

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.643
- MY, MY, MY.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.546
WHAT A BEAUTIFUL DAY
IN MONTGOMERY, ALABAMA.

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:17.583
I SWEAR, THE SUN IS SO HOT,
I NEARLY MELTED.

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.719
- INDEED, DR. KING,
BUT I SUSPECT

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:21.721
WE DIDN'T MEET HERE
TO TALK ABOUT THE WEATHER.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:25.191
- INDEED,
BROTHER MALCOLM.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.727
UNLESS, OF COURSE,
WE ARTICULATE

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.730
THAT THE SUN
IN THIS COUNTRY

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.133
SHINES BRIGHTER ON SOME
THAN IT DOES ON OTHERS.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:38.504
- MM.
- YEAH.

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:42.208
- YES, BUT WHEN THE SUN
DOES SHINE ON US,

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:45.144
IT IS GROWING
THE SEEDS OF REVOLUTION.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:49.349
- AMEN.
- THAT'S WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.486
- I SEE YOUR POINT,
BROTHER MALCOLM,

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:59.092
BUT DO NOT THOSE SAME SEEDS
NEED TO BE WATERED WITH LOVE?

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.494
[audience murmurs in agreement]

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:06.266
- I SUPPOSE THAT IS THE SUBJECT
OF SOME DISCUSSION, DR. KING.

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:09.402
- [coughs]

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:12.605
- AND I AM ALL FOR DISCUSSION,
BROTHER MALCOLM.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:14.874
UNLESS, OF COURSE,
THE WORDS DEVOLVE

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.743
INTO PROCLAMATIONS
OF HATE.

00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:20.847
- YES.
- RIGHT.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:25.751
- WELL, IS THAT NOT
WHY WE ARE HERE TODAY, DR. KING,

00:01:25.784 --> 00:01:28.187
TO DISCUSS?

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:31.291
[fly buzzes]

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.229
- YES, BROTHER MALCOLM.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.665
AND I AM CONFIDENT,
THAT AS WE DISCUSS--

00:01:39.698 --> 00:01:40.800
- WE ARE GOING TO DISCUSS IT

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.802
AND DISCUSS IT

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:47.607
UNTIL I SAY THAT

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:52.145
OUR PEOPLE
HAVE NEVER RESORTED TO VIOLENCE

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.214
BEFORE THE WHITE MAN
GAVE THEM NO CHOICE

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:56.449
BUT TO PAY HIM BACK

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.818
IN THE ONLY CURRENCY
HE UNDERSTANDS.

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:00.253
- YES.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:04.657
[applause]

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.425
- BROTHER MALCOLM,

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:08.928
IS THAT WHAT YOU
REALLY HAVE TO SAY...

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:11.731
AT THIS POINT...
IN OUR LUNCH?

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.300
- INDEED, DR. KING,

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.569
BECAUSE WE DIDN'T LAND
ON PLYMOUTH ROCK.

00:02:16.602 --> 00:02:20.439
PLYMOUTH ROCK
LANDED ON US.

00:02:20.472 --> 00:02:24.610
[audience shouts in agreement]

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:26.946
- AMEN.
- MM-HMM.

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:28.581
- OKAY, WELL, YES.
ALL RIGHT.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:30.917
YEAH, I-I'VE HEARD
YOU SAY THAT BEFORE.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:34.954
I...DON'T KNOW WHY
WE'RE TALKING ABOUT ROCKS WHEN,

00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:37.857
IN FACT,
IT IS THE FLESH AND THE BONE

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.493
AND THE--THE DREAMS--
I-I HAVE A DREAM

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:43.429
THAT SOMEDAY OUR CHILDREN
WILL BE JUDGED

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:45.331
BY THE CONTENT
OF THEIR CHARACTER,

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.733
NOT BY THE COLOR
OF THEIR SKIN.

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:50.870
[cheers and applause]

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:52.471
- SAME FOR ME.
SAME FOR ME.

00:02:52.504 --> 00:02:54.941
IN FACT,
I BELIEVE THAT ONE DAY,

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.609
A BLACK MAN
WILL BECOME THE PRESIDENT

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:58.611
OF THE UNITED STATES
OF AMERICA.

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.479
all: YES.

00:03:00.512 --> 00:03:02.682
- HOPEFULLY FOR EIGHT YEARS.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.350
OBAMA 2012.

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:07.887
[cheers and applause]

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.623
- OH, OF COURSE, EIGHT YEARS.
OF COURSE, EIGHT YEARS.

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:12.725
THAT'S A GIVEN, RIGHT?
[laughs] THAT'S A GIVEN.

00:03:12.758 --> 00:03:15.628
YOU KNOW? I MEAN,
BUT IN ORDER TO GET THERE,

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.930
ISN'T HE GOING TO NEED
THE HELP

00:03:17.963 --> 00:03:21.801
OF OUR STRONG, BEAUTIFUL,
BLACK WOMEN?

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:22.802
[cheers and applause]

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.804
GOTTA RESPECT THE SISTER.

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.306
GOTTA RESPECT
THE SISTER!

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:29.008
GOTTA RESPECT THE SISTER.

00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:30.643
[cheers and applause]

00:03:30.676 --> 00:03:33.246
- AS WESLEY SNIPES SAID
IN<i> PASSENGER 57,</i>

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.915
"ALWAYS BET ON BLACK."
LA LA LA.

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:40.586
[cheers and applause]

00:03:40.619 --> 00:03:45.324
- ♪ THE WEST SIDE
IS THE BEST SIDE ♪

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:49.462
[cheers and applause]

